# Drifting Relay Buoy (CIPlay drifting_relay_buoy): the sand bar at 1 m round 0 0, the buoy round 12 0; the buoy, the
# message, the box, the lamp, the answer.
island Drifting Relay Buoy
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Relay Buoy
expect hidden relayanswer
zone buoy
expect step 1
read Relay message
expect step 2
open Buoy box
wait 3
expect step 3
use buoylamp
expect shown relayanswer
expect step 4
# (deep pass 10-24: the top locker refuses, the dive, the air bell, the dive chest, the buried tins, the tower)
open Mast locker
expect message relay keyhole
zone rb_dive
expect step 5
air rb_air
open Relay 6 chest
wait 3
expect story relay6 1
expect step 6
open Relay 6 float box
wait 3
dig 1
climb -21.91 -11.97
open Mast stash
wait 3
read Dune cairn
dig 0
zone rb_top
expect step 7
open Mast locker
wait 3
expect step 8
read Relay answer
expect done
